{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣男星林柏宏演出南韓導演朴勳正執導的新片《悲傷熱帶》，下月中將於台灣上映。</p><p>對於首度挑戰韓片，柏宏既興奮又緊張，拍攝期間要克服韓文聽力與手語溝通的挑戰，更靠鳳梨酥及牛軋糖跟台前幕後打破隔閡，難怪他笑言是「零食外交」。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T16:25:59.360367+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T16:01:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T16:19:08.345939+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T16:19:08.345939+00:00","content_hash":"8a046a68d54aca989a5f658ac72fa544f12d8be63ce391529944ce71f5bc6713","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}